gametitle=Ryu ga Gotoku (Japan) / Yakuza 1 - SLPM-66168 (B7B3800A)
// Public release v1.0: validated v0.3 bottom/right coverage commands, unchanged.
// v0.2 bottom-band removal was user-confirmed in the supplied street screenshot.
// Bottom and right edge removal was user-confirmed in tested street scenes on 2026-10-27.
// Other scenes and full-game compatibility are not fully verified.
// Keep Vulkan / 4x. This patch does not crop, translate the viewport, or remove effects.
// Only six additional X words change: final sprite endpoint 511.5 -> 512.0.
// Internal strip boundaries, UVs, colors, and game code are unchanged.
// Replace earlier test patches with this file. Do not combine with v0.1.
// Original, v0.2, and v0.3 memory states are accepted; v0.1 code signatures are refused.
// To fully undo a patch, cold-boot and use a memory-card save or an unpatched state.

[Bottom and Right Edge Fix v1.0]
description=Preserve the full frame at 4x: correct bottom and right effect-rectangle coverage. User-confirmed in tested street scenes. Full-game compatibility not certified.
author=Codex

